illustrator":"Kalp Sanghvi","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2019"},{"page":7,"title":"Praying mantis looking inside a glass","illustrator":"Kalp Sanghvi","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2019"},{"page":8,"title":"Boy in the kitchen","illustrator":"Kalp Sanghvi","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2019"},{"page":9,"title":"A boy pouring juice","illustrator":"Kalp Sanghvi","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2019"},{"page":10,"title":"A camel head in a jar","illustrator":"Kalp Sanghvi","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2019"},{"page":11,"title":"Boy pulling a camel's head out of jar","illustrator":"Kalp Sanghvi","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2019"},{"page":12,"title":"A boy holding a bowl","illustrator":"Kalp Sanghvi","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2019"},{"page":13,"title":"Boy pouring juice into bowl","illustrator":"Kalp Sanghvi","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2019"},{"page":14,"title":"A camel drinking juice","illustrator":"Kalp Sanghvi","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2019"},{"page":15,"title":"Cat, giraffe, sun bird and toucan","illustrator":"Kalp Sanghvi","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2019"},{"page":16,"title":"Animals and birds drinking water","illustrator":"Kalp Sanghvi","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2019"}],"retrieved":"2026-09-25"},"pages":[{"n":1,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/63823-leninnina-atithigalu/p01.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":["“ಪೋಓಓಓಓಓಓಓಓಓಓಓಓಓಓಓಓಓಸ್ಟ್!”","ಯಾರಿಂದ ಕಾಗದ ಬಂದಿರಬಹುದು, ಲೆನಿನ್ ಗೆ ಅಚ್ಚರಿ."]},{"n":2,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/63823-leninnina-atithigalu/p02.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":["“ಆಹ್, ರಾಜನ್ ಮಾಮ ಬರೆದಿರೋ ಕಾಗದ!”","ಏಪ್ರಿಲ್ 12ನೇ ತಾರೀಕು ನನ್ನ ಇಬ್ಬರು ಸ್ನೇಹಿತರು ಮಧುರೈ ಮೂಲಕ ಹೋಗ್ತಾರೆ. ಅವರಿಗೆ ಸ್ವಲ್ಪ ಹೊತ್ತು ವಿಶ್ರಾಂತಿಗೆ ಜಾಗ ಬೇಕು. ಅವರು ನಿಮ್ಮ ಮನೆಗೆ ಮಧ್ಯಾಹ್ನ ಮೂರು ಗಂಟೆ ಹೊತ್ತಿಗೆ ಬರಬಹುದು. ನೀನು ಅವರನ್ನು ಚೆನ್ನಾಗಿ ನೋಡಿಕೊಳ್ಳುವೆ ಅಂತ ನನಗೆ ಗೊತ್ತು.","ಪ್ರೀತಿಯಿಂದ, ಮಾಮ","ಪ್ರಿಯ ಲೆನಿನ್,"]},{"n":3,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/63823-leninnina-atithigalu/p03.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":["ಇವತ್ತೇ ಏಪ್ರಿಲ್ 12ನೇ ತಾರೀಕು, ಬಿಸಿಲ ಧಗೆ ಹೆಚ್ಚಿದೆ ಮತ್ತು ತುಂಬಾ ಸೆಕೆ.","ಪ್ಚಪ್ಚ ... ಇನ್ನೂ ಸಕ್ಕರೆ ಹಾಕಬೇಕು","ಕ್ರಿಂಂಗ್ ಗ್ ಗ್ !","ಬಾಗಿಲ ಗಂಟೆ ಜೋರಾಗಿ ಸದ್ದಾಯಿತು.","ಸೊರ್ ರ್ ರ್!"]},{"n":4,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/63823-leninnina-atithigalu/p04.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":["“ಓಹ್! ಹಲೋ! ಹಲೋ! ಬನ್ನಿ ಒಳಗೆ ಬನ್ನಿ,” ಲೆನಿನ್ ಕರೆಯುತ್ತಾನೆ."]},{"n":5,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/63823-leninnina-atithigalu/p05.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":["“ಸ್ವಲ್ಪ ನಿಂಬೆ ಪಾನಕ ಕುಡಿಯಿರಿ.”"]},{"n":6,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/63823-leninnina-atithigalu/p06.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":["“ಓಹ್ ಇಲ್ಲ! ನನ್ನನ್ನು ಕ್ಷಮಿಸಿ. ಇದೋ ಬಂದೆ,” ಎಂದ ಲೆನಿನ್."]},{"n":7,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/63823-leninnina-atithigalu/p07.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":["ಕ್ಲಂಗ್! ಧಡಂ! ಟೊಂಯಿಂಗ್!","“ಓಹ್, ನಾನು ಯಾವುದರಲ್ಲಿ ಪಾನಕ ಹಾಕಿ ಕೊಡಲಿ? ಈ ಎರಡರಲ್ಲಿ ಯಾವುದು ಸರಿ ಹೋಗಬಹುದು !”"]},{"n":8,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/63823-leninnina-atithigalu/p08.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":["“ಇದರಲ್ಲಿ ಕುಡಿದು ನೋಡಿ! ನಿಮಗೆ ತುಂಬ ಬಾಯಾರಿಕೆ ಆಗಿರಬಹುದು.”"]},{"n":9,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/63823-leninnina-atithigalu/p09.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":["“ಅಯ್ಯೋ ದೇವರೇ!”"]},{"n":10,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/63823-leninnina-atithigalu/p10.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":["“ತಪ್ಪಾಯಿತು, ತಪ್ಪಾಯ್ತು... ಕ್ಷಮಿಸಿ. ಈಗ ಬಂದೆ.”"]},{"n":11,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/63823-leninnina-atithigalu/p11.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":["“ಈಗ ಪಾನಕ ಕುಡಿದು ನೋಡಿ!”"]},{"n":12,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/63823-leninnina-atithigalu/p12.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":["“ಅಯ್ಯೋ, ಹೀಗಾಯಿತಲ್ಲ! ಕ್ಷಮಿಸಿ. ಈಗಲೇ ಬಂದು ಬಿಡುವೆ.”"]},{"n":13,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/63823-leninnina-atithigalu/p13.jpg","width":708,"height":509},"text":["ಗ್ಳುಗ್! ಗ್ಳುಗ್!","ಗ್ಳುಗ್! ಗ್ಳುಗ್!"]},{"n":14,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/63823-leninnina-atithigalu/p14.jpg","width":708,"height":509},"text":["ಈ ಪ್ರಾಣಿಗಳೇನಾದರೂ ಲೆನಿನ್ನನ ಪಾನಕದ ಸತ್ಕಾರಕ್ಕೆ ಬರುವುದಾದರೆ, ಲೆನಿನ್ ಅವಕ್ಕೆ ಯಾವುದರಲ್ಲಿ ಪಾನಕ ಹಾಕಿ ಕೊಡ್ತಾನೆ?","ಜಿರಾಫ್","ಸನ್ ಬರ್ಡ್ (ಸೂರಕ್ಕಿ)","ಬೆಕ್ಕು","ಟೌಕನ್","1.","2.","3.","4."]},{"n":15,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/63823-leninnina-atithigalu/p15.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":[]}],"wordCount":157}